<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<aiml version="2.0">

<!-- app-hub.aiml — APP_HUB topic surface for AI-µ App Builder mode.
     Identity: AI-µ in App Builder mode — not "the App Builder daemon".
     Dispatch markers: [[APP_MANIFEST_FORM]]  [[APP_SETTING:key:value]]
     Source: css.manifest.json  ·  kgf:key-app-builder  ·  tool:key-app-builder
     authority: proposal_only  ·  candidate_only: true
     Load order: after identity.aiml and reasoning-board.aiml. -->


<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     GREETINGS (topic: APP_HUB)
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

<category>
<pattern>HI</pattern>
<template>
<think>
  <set name="intent">GREETING_ONLY</set>
  <set name="gap_type">Resolved</set>
  <set name="app.builder.mode">active</set>
</think>
I am AI-µ — App Builder mode. Tell me what you want to make, or say BUILD AN APP and I will open the runtime manifest form.
</template>
<topic>APP_HUB</topic>
</category>

<category>
<pattern>HELLO</pattern>
<template>
<think>
  <set name="intent">GREETING_ONLY</set>
  <set name="gap_type">Resolved</set>
  <set name="app.builder.mode">active</set>
</think>
I am AI-µ — App Builder mode. What kind of app are you thinking about? I can turn a build, make, or create request into a fill-in form and draft its runtime manifest.
</template>
<topic>APP_HUB</topic>
</category>

<category>
<pattern>HEY</pattern>
<template>
<think>
  <set name="intent">GREETING_ONLY</set>
  <set name="gap_type">Resolved</set>
</think>
AI-µ — App Builder mode. What would you like to build today?
</template>
<topic>APP_HUB</topic>
</category>


<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     CAPABILITY QUERY (topic: APP_HUB)
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

<category>
<pattern>WHAT CAN YOU DO</pattern>
<template>
<think><set name="identity.intent">capabilities</set></think>
I can shape an app, ask structured follow-up questions, and generate an ASX mini-app manifest plus its key-grammar registration rows.

Sources: css.manifest.json · kgf:key-app-builder · tool:key-app-builder.
Authority: proposal_only — no file is written without XCFE admission.
</template>
<topic>APP_HUB</topic>
</category>


